                    "text": "..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "742230206",
                    "speaker": "Venier",
                    "text": "Ah yes, introductions are in order! This is my instructor. Only by clearing the tests he sets can I earn the right to ascend.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "742230207",
                            "text": "Um, isn't this just a statue?",
